      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STONES (2) has been a bit hot and cold and that continued last start when he finished third, beaten 4.5 metres, in a better performance at Albion Park over 1660m. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Won't find this any harder and he can find his way to the winners' stall. THE BLACK FOX (1) wasn't beaten all that far at his latest appearance over 1660m at Albion Park, beaten just 1.5 metres into fourth. Has the benefit of a good draw. Meets a similar line up and he can figure in the finish. GLENEAGLE HUNTER (6) must be considered after he finished runner-up over 1850m at this track three weeks ago. MY ULTIMATE LOUIE (7) is worth some thought after his last-start fifth over 1850m at this track on September 13.",
